google.visualization.Query.setResponse({"version":"0.6","reqId":"0","status":"ok","sig":"1315031258","table":{"cols":[{"id":"A","label":"","type":"string"},{"id":"B","label":"","type":"string"}],"rows":[{"c":[null,{"v":"🎯 Objective of the EROOM optimization framework"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This diagnostic assesses the maturity of a digital service in order to identify its main optimization levers: algorithm, code, architecture, operations, data, hosting, etc."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Each question covers a factor influencing performance, efficiency, or maintainability."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The diagnostic is not a performance grade: it helps determine action priorities. There are no \"good\" or \"bad\" grades, only improvement opportunities."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"📊 Rating scale"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"For each criterion, give a score from 1 to 5 based on the current level of mastery."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"1 = not mastered / unknown"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"5 = mastered and measured"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Each question contributes equally to the overall score, which is then converted into a percentage of optimization potential (0% to 100%)."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This percentage reflects the remaining room for improvement for the service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"A low individual score highlights an improvement opportunity, while a high score indicates that good practices are already in place."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🧮 Interpreting the scores"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The total score is expressed as a percentage of the optimization potential."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 High percentage → strong improvement potential (technical, organizational, or environmental)."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 Low percentage → service already mature or efficient."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The diagnostic does not assign a performance grade."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"It is designed to prioritize actions and identify the areas where improvement efforts will have the most impact."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"There are no \"good\" or \"bad\" results, only opportunities to act."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"💡 Who is it for?"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The EROOM quick diagnostic is designed to be lightweight and accessible, but it requires a basic understanding of the technical context."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This can be done by:"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 someone familiar with the technical environment, able to assess the maturity of current practices;"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 a technical-product pair, to cross-check viewpoints and ensure alignment between technical and functional priorities;"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"\u2022 a technical-product pair, to cross-check viewpoints and ensure alignment between technical and functional priorities;"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"💡 How to use"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"One diagnostic corresponds to a single digital service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"An organization can therefore run several quick diagnostics to map its entire information system and identify the areas where action should be taken as a priority."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 1 - Duplicate the file"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"This tool is provided as a Google Sheets spreadsheet."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Start by duplicating the file for your personal use, so you can enter your answers without modifying the original template."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 2 - Define the scope"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The diagnostic is performed for a digital service, a platform, or the entire information system."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Each assessed service must have its own dedicated sheet."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 4 - Answer the questions - 0 - Quick diagnostic"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Give each question a score from 1 to 5, based on the available information."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"1 = not mastered / unknown"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"5 = mastered, measured, optimised"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"If in doubt, select 1 (\"I don\u0027t know\") or choose a cautious score, and note the point to clarify later."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"You can ignore any criterion by setting its weight to \"Not applicable\"."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"If the quick diagnostic score is very low, there is no need to continue with the detailed steps. The optimization potential is either already low or too hard to reach, so it is more effective to focus on other services."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 5 - Answer the questions - 1 - Product to - 5 - Algo&Code"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"✅ Confirmed strength = already handled, no improvement potential possible."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"💡 Improvement potential identified = not fully exploited, significant room for improvement remains."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"You can ignore any criterion by setting its weight to \"Not applicable\"."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 6 - Answer the questions - 6 - Ease of change"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🟢 Easy to change = can be updated with minimal obstacles."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🟡 Moderate effort = making the change would be a feasible challenge."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"🔴 Hard to change = implementing the change would be difficult."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"You can ignore any criterion by setting its weight to \"Not applicable\"."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 7 - Collaborate across the different roles"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Carry out the diagnostic with technical, product, and corporate social responsibility (CSR) representatives, in order to reach a shared understanding — not to grade the teams."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"The goal is to reach a shared understanding, not to assign a performance grade."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Low score → mature, already efficient service."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"High score → strong optimization potential (technical, organizational, or environmental)."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Step 7 - Use the results"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Compare the results across the different services."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Those with the best scores become the priority candidates for a more in-depth analysis within the EROOM program."}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"Licence CC-BY-SA"}]},{"c":[null,{"v":"« Cette licence permet aux réutilisateurs de distribuer, remixer, adapter et dévelo